{"step_index":326,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T15:56:55Z","content":"### UI Redesigned: Clean, Structured & Separated Blocks\n\n---\n\n### 1. Neat Separations After Each Block & Topic\n- Replaced all custom unclosed HTML tags with Streamlit's native **`st.container(border=True)`** architecture.\n- Every topic now sits in its own distinct, contained card with clean borders, subtle dark contrast, and consistent padding:\n  - **Batch Ingestion Block**: Contained upload area with clear action buttons and progress feedback.\n  - **Inspection Gallery Grid**: Each inspected unit is encapsulated in its own clean bordered card with header, badge, image, and probability breakdown.\n  - **Batch Telemetry & Log Table**: Enclosed in its own analytical card.\n  - **Line Performance & Bottleneck Diagnosis**: Structured KPI card and dedicated constraint diagnosis banner.\n  - **Station Telemetry & Buffer Accumulation**: Side-by-side balanced charts in a dedicated container.\n  - **Causal Correlation & Drift Tracking**: Neatly separated evidence cards.\n  - **Financial Waterfall & What-If Simulator**: Contained economic models with sliders and ROI metrics.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Removed \"NEURAX 3.0\" Branding\n- **Main Header**: Replaced with a clean industrial title:\n  > **Visual Inspection & Defect Root-Cause Assistant**  \n  > *Unified Quality Intelligence, Process Bottleneck Diagnostics & Economic Optimization*\n- **Page Title**: Changed to `Industrial AI Platform`.\n- **Sidebar & Footer**: Completely stripped of all \"NEURAX 3.0\" references.\n\n---\n\n### ⚡ Refresh & View:\nSimply refresh your browser tab or run:\n```powershell\ncd C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\neurax_app\npython -m streamlit run app.py\n```"}
